      "text": [
        "Welcome to Your",
        "Country Escape",
        "Happy Valley Farms is a restored treasure nestled in the hills of North Georgia. Once a quiet country estate, now thoughtfully reimagined as an agri-tourism destination where history, hospitality, and natural beauty come together.",
        "We’ve preserved the charm of the past while creating something new: a gathering place where elegant events, equestrian excellence, and outdoor adventure live side by side. From historic buildings to modern amenities, every corner of the farm tells a story."
      ]
    },
