      "text": [
        "The Stable",
        "AT HAPPY VALLEY FARMS",
        "We take pride in our dedication to equestrian excellence, providing top-tier boarding, hunter/jumper facilities, and training. At our historic farm, riders have the opportunity to refine their skills in a picturesque setting, surrounded by expansive riding arenas and meticulously designed courses."
      ]
    },
