      "text": [
        "Enjoy Life on the Farm",
        "Stay",
        "Indulge in the unique charm of staying at Happy Valley Farms. Our historic 1936 mansion, pool house, rustic log cabin, and cozy new cottages offer a blend of luxury and heritage. Immerse yourself in the tranquil beauty of the countryside, just a stone's throw from Chattanooga, TN.",
        "Explore",
        "Wander through 220 acres of open fields, shady trails, and beautifully restored landmarks. From disc golf to horseback riding, there's something for everyone. What was once overgrown is now open for exploration.",
        "Events",
        "Envision your ideal event at Happy Valley Farms, where historic elegance meets modern amenities near Chattanooga, TN. The Colonial Revival mansion will soon offer 10,000 sq. ft. of luxurious space. The Stable adds an equestrian flair to any gathering, while The Dairy Barn is being transformed to fea"
      ]
